# .gitattributes — how git merges what both sides changed (protected path, law 7).
#
# The worklog is append-only, so two machines (or two sessions) that each added
# receipts never conflict: union keeps both sides' new lines. This is what lets
# sync.sh and session-start.sh bring GitHub's side and this machine's together
# without a human in the loop (PF-033).
os/worklog.md merge=union
